After building %OpenMS and TOPP, you should test your installation by
executing the following command:

\code
make test
\endcode

or

\code
ctest
\endcode

By using `ctest` you can also execute a subset of tests by using the
`-R SUBSTRING` option and run tests in parallel using the `-j` option.
For example,

\code
ctest -R TOPP_ -j 4
\endcode

will run all TOPP test using 4 jobs.

For more information, consult the `ctest` [man page][ctest].

[ctest]: http://manpages.ubuntu.com/manpages/hardy/man1/ctest.1.html
